{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a fresh take on the classic bubble shooter genre with Bubbits! <strong>Wishlist now</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/4bf2ee2d0d5a7a71f3a64be69060cb16.poster.avif?t=1770074205\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/4bf2ee2d0d5a7a71f3a64be69060cb16.webm?t=1770074205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in massive 25-player online battle royale matches or go head-to-head with friends in the intense 2-4 player VS mode. Take on the world in the daily challenge or embrace the timeless classic bubble shooter experience in the singleplayer adventure mode with a variety of levels and special challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/1246df94ac2e766af7020285fc64db7c.poster.avif?t=1770074205\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/1246df94ac2e766af7020285fc64db7c.webm?t=1770074205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun Power Ups &amp; Crazy Battle Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash game-changing powerups and adapt to dynamic battle events that change up the game. Climb the ranks and rise from bronze to grandmaster bub! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/bb0bba5ec3434d306b875ba86697ea7b.poster.avif?t=1770074205\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/bb0bba5ec3434d306b875ba86697ea7b.webm?t=1770074205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/54c15e9c58ed2f30f14d3684d5368340.poster.avif?t=1770074205\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/54c15e9c58ed2f30f14d3684d5368340.webm?t=1770074205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization - Pop the competition in style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're casually playing or in the final of a Bubbits royale, bring your personal flair and make every victory your own. Customize your playfield unique characters, different cannons and environments, and bring your groove if you make it to the royale final. Enjoy lag-free online battles on dedicated servers, where your skills and quick reflexes truly decide your fate. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2483270?t=1770074205","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/420c7408e569b15ed70c632a8221386eb057e6b0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770074205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/4a51ef2feb44f7c0eb0318393a673ca5166d8619/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770074205","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/4a51ef2feb44f7c0eb0318393a673ca5166d8619/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770074205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descr