tles on dedicated servers, where your skills and quick reflexes truly decide your fate. </p>","developers":["Team Flow"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/de31040d9a2d2b9c087487462b79bde8106dd0a2/header.jpg?t=1770074205","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Zen 2 4c/8t, 2.4-3.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 RDNA 2 CUs, 1.6GHz<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2483270/749997/b4d27319a1c85f35b16b4751aa43a28b9cb245f9/1750923747/dash_av1.mpd?t=1726051427","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2483270/749997/b4d27319a1c85f35b16b4751aa43a28b9cb245f9/1750923747/dash_h264.mpd?t=1726051427","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2483270/749997/b4d27319a1c85f35b16b4751aa43a28b9cb245f9/1750923747/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1726051427","id":257051786,"name":"Bubbits Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257051786/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1726051427"}],"name":"Bubbits","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 Core i3 8350k or AMD Ryzen3 3200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel\u00ae UHD Graphics 630 or Radeon\u2122 Vega 8 Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet co